I feel like it was the beginning of my life,

1180
00:50:17.750 --> 00:50:19.060
in a weird way.

1181
00:50:19.060 --> 00:50:24.060
Like, it was like the first of so much to come.

1182
00:50:25.670 --> 00:50:27.770
And it was a springboard for sure,

1183
00:50:27.770 --> 00:50:29.320
