00:51:07.390 --> 00:51:08.900
Did I know that at the time?

1200
00:51:08.900 --> 00:51:10.351
No.

1201
00:51:10.351 --> 00:51:11.184
Did I know that 10 years after?

1202
00:51:11.184 --> 00:51:12.017
No.

1203
00:51:12.017 --> 00:51:14.543
Do I look at it now and say, oh, wow,

1204
00:51:15.660 --> 00:51:17.320
that was a beautiful thing.

1205
00:51:17.320 --> 00:51:18.810
And I'm so glad that I can look at

1206
00:51:18.810 --> 00:51:21.520
that experience and say, holy shit,

1207
00:51:21.520 --> 00:51:23.470
I stood on the podium in front of the world

1208
00:51:23.470 --> 00:51:28.073
