Because to me, it doesn't symbolize this, 200 Free.

1214
00:51:42.880 --> 00:51:44.410
Yeah, that's great.

1215
00:51:44.410 --> 00:51:47.623
But it's, to get there, it took all versions of me.

1216
00:51:48.680 --> 00:51:49.690
And then to go from there,

1217
00:51:49.690 --> 00:51:52.563
it's gonna take a whole different, Caroline.

1218
00:51:53.500 --> 00:51:56.640
And I think that feeling and that realization

1219
00:51:56.640 --> 00:52:00.090
is powerful to feel that you can have stages

1220
00:52:00.090 --> 00:52:01.240
of your life like that.

1221
00:52:02.080 --> 00:52:04.810
What do people not fully understand

1222
00:52:04.810 --> 00:52:07.054
about the Olympic experience.

1223
00:52:07.054 --> 00:52:11.723
I mean, I suspect it's gotta be disorienting to go from,

1224
00:52:13.130 --> 00:52:16.360
churning out sets in Gainesville

1225
00:52:16.360 --> 00:52:20.580
