Yeah, well, I love yours, by the way

3266
02:23:40.510 --> 02:23:44.410
that I just got, wish I got it a long time ago.

3267
02:23:44.410 --> 02:23:46.780
It's gonna help anybody with their people pleasing.

3268
02:23:46.780 --> 02:23:51.780
No, it does but it also does help you feel not alone.

3269
02:23:52.830 --> 02:23:54.500
So that's huge.

3270
02:23:54.500 --> 02:23:58.690
The, my favorite books are very abstract.

3271
