"Loyalty To Your Soul."

3278
02:24:17.420 --> 02:24:20.560
I read like a lot of mind body style books

3279
02:24:20.560 --> 02:24:21.393
to where you're integrating

3280
02:24:21.393 --> 02:24:24.040
like energy centers with mindset work.

3281
02:24:24.040 --> 02:24:26.440
So it's an abstract way of thinking.

3282
02:24:26.440 --> 02:24:28.780
I could name all my books and sports likes

3283
02:24:28.780 --> 02:24:31.420
in grad school, but those are just sports likes.

3284
02:24:31.420 --> 02:24:34.140
I'm thinking more in the context of somebody

3285
02:24:34.140 --> 02:24:37.220
who's dealing with these kind of particular emotional things

3286
02:24:37.220 --> 02:24:39.840
that you've been dealing with.

3287
02:24:39.840 --> 02:24:40.673
And I didn't read a book for

3288
02:24:40.673 --> 02:24:41.720
however many years during--

3289
