I didn't read one single book.

3291
02:24:46.730 --> 02:24:48.900
I started reading like when I broke my heel,

3292
02:24:48.900 --> 02:24:50.000
I start reading again.

3293
02:24:51.108 --> 02:24:51.941
I start doing everything

3294
02:24:53.337 --> 02:24:54.170
that I hadn't done again, to try.

3295
02:24:54.170 --> 02:24:55.890
But those are the books I gravitated toward.

3296
02:24:55.890 --> 02:24:59.120
I gravitated toward books that felt like

3297
02:24:59.120 --> 02:25:01.900
intuitively they were calling me to they were

3298
02:25:01.900 --> 02:25:04.780
I was drawn to them 'cause they were about the things

3299
02:25:04.780 --> 02:25:09.340
that I felt unseen with that I that I needed

3300
02:25:09.340 --> 02:25:11.060
to understand better about myself,

3301
02:25:11.060 --> 02:25:14.880
which was that connection between the mind and the body

3302
02:25:14.880 --> 02:25:17.890
in a way that wasn't just psychology and sports psych,

3303
02:25:17.890 --> 02:25:20.640
then where there was like a very spiritual sense

3304
02:25:20.640 --> 02:25:24.333
that I could understand a little bit better about myself.

3305
02:25:25.200 --> 02:25:26.560
But there are several others in there

3306
02:25:26.560 --> 02:25:30.480
that I really enjoyed throughout that time.

